Copyright 2026 David Teschner

This project contains no SCIEX SDK, no Clearcore2 assemblies, and no SCIEX
proprietary code. The .wiff / .wiff.scan layout is reconstructed entirely from the
data files themselves, read through their OLE2/CFB container with the `cfb` crate.
No existing .wiff reader informed this implementation; it derives from the files'
own self-describing structure.

No sample .wiff or .wiff.scan files are distributed with this project. Tests that
exercise genuine vendor data are environment-gated (TIMSIM_SCIEX_WIFF_SCAN=<path>)
and read files the user supplies from outside the repository, so no vendor data is
redistributed here.

The SCIEX and ZenoTOF names, and the .wiff and .wiff.scan formats, are the property
of their respective owners. This project is an independent, clean-room
implementation and is not affiliated with or endorsed by SCIEX.
